                <invention-title lang="de">SPENDER FÜR FLÜCHTIGE STOFFE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISTRIBUTEUR DE MATIERE VOLATILE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VOLATILE MATERIAL DISPENSER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A volatile material dispenser (50), comprising: a base (56) that houses a printed circuit board (PCB, 216); a stand assembly (116) that is coupled with the base (56) via one or more fastening mechanisms (130), the stand assembly (116) including a platform (118), a stand (120) that extends from the platform (118), and a manifold (126) that extends from the stand (120); and a refill (52) that is removably coupled with the manifold (126), the refill (52) comprising a cylindrical wick (188), wherein the manifold (126) houses a piezoelectric assembly (110) that includes a piezoelectric element (112) and a piezoelectric plate (260) including a dome (264), wherein the piezoelectric plate (260) defines an array (269) of apertures (268) being disposed entirely along the dome (264), wherein the array (269) of apertures (268) are disposed in a circular array, wherein outer most apertures of the array (269) of apertures (268) define an array diameter (DA) and contact between the wick (188) and the piezoelectric plate (260) define a wick diameter (DW), and wherein a ratio of the wick diameter and the array diameter (DW/DA) is greater than 1.0.</p>
            </abstract>
